{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792479900, "covers_from": "2026-10-20T07:05:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-20T07:06:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792479960, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-20T07:05:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15024, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "市政", "content": "台北爛好久了，尤其蔣萬安這三年多是爛到出汁，支持沈伯洋成為你的市長，台北人這次要吃好一點，別再被笑了", "display_name": "中山代表 No.15,024", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T07:05:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 8387, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "貨車臨停常常擋到人行道", "display_name": "中山代表 No.8,387", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T07:05:20+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 15135, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我希望市長幫忙老舊建築的老人能在解決電梯下。走出家門\n年紀大上下樓梯是生活的大困境\n我們一直在等待市", "display_name": "大安代表 游秋真", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T07:05:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 62240, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "育兒", "content": "上個月帶小孩推推車去台北車站，想從台北車站一樓搭電梯下樓去捷運站（含地下街），竟然沒電梯可以搭乘", "display_name": "中正代表 No.62,240", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T07:05:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37809, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "士林中正路上的蟑螂也太多了吧，晚上走路都要小心翼翼的。", "display_name": "士林代表 No.37,809", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 8387, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.8,387", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 15135, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 游秋真", "district": "daan